e>Bae</surname><given-names>HI</given-names></name><name><surname>Crawley</surname><given-names>SC</given-names></name><name><surname>Yang</surname><given-names>SC</given-names></name><name><surname>Gum</surname><given-names>JR</given-names><suffix>Jr.</suffix></name><name><surname>Batra</surname><given-names>SK</given-names></name><name><surname>Rousseau</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Swallow</surname><given-names>DM</given-names></name><name><surname>Sleisenger</surname><given-names>MH</given-names></name><name><surname>Kim</surname><given-names>YS</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Aberrant expression of MUC3 and MUC4 membrane-associated mucins and sialyl Le(x) antigen in pancreatic intraepithelial neoplasia</article-title><source>Pancreas</source><year>2003</year><volume>26</volume><fpage>e48</fpage><lpage>54</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12657964</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1097/00006676-200304000-00022</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B12"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Rakha</surname><given-names>EA</given-names></name><name><surname>Boyce</surname><given-names>RW</given-names></name><name><surname>Abd El-Rehim</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Kurien</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Green</surname><given-names>AR</given-names></name><name><surname>Paish</surname><given-names>EC</given-names></name><name><surname>Robertson</surname><given-names>JF</given-names></name><name><surname>Ellis</surname><given-names>IO</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Expression of mucins (MUC1, MUC2, MUC3, MUC4, MUC5AC and MUC6) and their prognostic significance in human breast cancer</article-title><source>Mod Pathol</source><year>2005</year><volume>18</volume><fpage>1295</fpage><lpage>1304</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15976813</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1038/modpathol.3800445</pub-id>